WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.434
-Our next guest is best known
for her role

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:04.934
as Hilda Spellman
on the ABC hit series

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:07.434
"Sabrina The Teenage Witch,"
as well as her --

00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:08.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:10.200
As well as her numerous
comedy specials.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.434
She will be performing at the
Epic Events Center in Green Bay,

00:00:13.434 --> 00:00:14.701
November 18th.

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:17.534
Please welcome the very funny
Caroline Rhea.

00:00:17.534 --> 00:00:19.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:26.067
♪♪

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:28.667
-Hi!
Thank you.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:30.467
I'm so happy to be in New York.

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:33.868
I live in Los Angeles now,
and everyone is very concerned

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:35.868
with their appearance there.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:38.934
Like, people always say to me,
"Caroline, your face is so full.

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:42.567
What kind of filler do you use?
Is it Restylane or Juvederm?"

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:46.100
I'm like, "Fudge."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.901
"I put a little
rocky road right here."

00:00:47.901 --> 00:00:49.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:51.501
"And then this is vanilla.
Yeah."

00:00:51.501 --> 00:00:53.133
And they're fussy eaters.
I have one friend,

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:54.834
she is so gluten-intolerant,

00:00:54.834 --> 00:00:56.868
she can't even listen
to Hall &amp; Oates.

00:00:56.868 --> 00:00:58.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:01.667
Yeah.

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:05.300
I was ghosted
by a man in his 70s. Yeah.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.834
I'm hoping he was just so old
he died and became a ghost.

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:10.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.400
So now I'm on this amazing
dating app, Taskrabbit.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.400
I love it.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.033
Yeah, it gets the job done.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:22.334
I live in a 100-year-old house,
and, seriously,

00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:24.667
I feel like my house
is just an old man

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:27.100
who married me for my money.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.767
No, it really is.
It's like an old man.

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:31.234
Like, the foundation,
it's not hard anymore.

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:33.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.901
There's very little wood.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.901 --> 00:01:39.267
It takes forever for any water
to come out of the pipes, and --

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:40.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.467
There's a lot of
spontaneous gas leaks

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:46.167
that it blames on the dog, so...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:48.534
I have one friend
who's obsessed with astrology.

00:01:48.534 --> 00:01:49.868
I mean, like, a crazy person.

00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:53.234
Admittedly, I did have to have
an emergency C-section

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:56.334
because I was very high risk
for having a Scorpio.

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:58.000
[ Laughter ]
And, um...

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.734
Yeah, there was no way
I wanted my daughter born

00:01:59.734 --> 00:02:02.000
that good at sex
and unable to forgive, so...

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.901
[ Laughter ]
Wasn't gonna happen.

00:02:04.901 --> 00:02:06.767
Yeah.

00:02:06.767 --> 00:02:09.934
I hate when people pretend they
don't know what sign they are.

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:11.300
Like, I asked this man
in Georgia.

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:14.067
I go "What sign are you?"
And he goes, "I have no idea."

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.033
I go, "Well, how old are you?"
He's like, "56."

00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:19.667
I go, "In 56 years,
no one has ever mentioned

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:21.234
what sign you are?"

00:02:21.234 --> 00:02:23.701
And he said,
"Um, I think I'm a 'lib-ra.'"

00:02:23.701 --> 00:02:25.834
[ Laughter ]
"Oh, a lib-ra.

00:02:25.834 --> 00:02:28.367
Did you read about that
in a 'hor-os-copy' book?"

00:02:28.367 --> 00:02:30.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.334 --> 00:02:33.467
"I thought perhaps you were
a 'ge-meanie' or a 'pish-ez.'"

00:02:33.467 --> 00:02:34.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.868 --> 00:02:36.300
"Maybe a 'vir-jo' or a 'canker,'

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:37.901
but you look like
a 'saggy-tit-a-raurus.'

00:02:37.901 --> 00:02:38.901
You really do."

00:02:38.901 --> 00:02:41.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:46.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:46.434 --> 00:02:49.767
My ex-boyfriend was a cancer --
in many ways.

00:02:49.767 --> 00:02:51.467
He, um --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:54.868
He was actually a lib-ra.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.868 --> 00:02:57.868
So, I had my daughter in my 40s,
and of course I breast-fed.

00:02:57.868 --> 00:03:01.667
And no one was more shocked
than my boobs, okay?

00:03:01.667 --> 00:03:02.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.834 --> 00:03:05.167
They'd been understudies
their entire life,

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:07.501
and they were like, "What?
We're going on?"

00:03:07.501 --> 00:03:09.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.434
"I don't even know
if I remember the part."

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:14.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.968
Having a teenager
and being a comedian,

00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:18.667
it often feels like the heckler

00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:20.267
just followed me home
from the club.

00:03:20.267 --> 00:03:22.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.300
She's so mean.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.133
She's like, "That's not funny."
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:26.133 --> 00:03:28.868
"What happened to your hair?
You smell like ranch."

00:03:28.868 --> 00:03:32.033
[ Laughter ]
I'm like, "I do?"

00:03:32.033 --> 00:03:35.033
It's so pathetic 'cause
all I want to do is please her.

00:03:35.033 --> 00:03:36.834
And I was watching
"House of the Dragon."

00:03:36.834 --> 00:03:38.100
I was very disappointed.

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.868
I thought it was just about
raising a teenager.

00:03:39.868 --> 00:03:42.000
And --
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.734
'Cause my daughter,
she's like an evil queen,

00:03:44.734 --> 00:03:46.934
and I'm like this pathetic
troll servant

00:03:46.934 --> 00:03:48.901
who endlessly tries
to please her.

00:03:48.901 --> 00:03:50.701
Like -- and I make a big deal
of everything.

00:03:50.701 --> 00:03:53.901
Even if I bring her, like,
a coffee, I'm like this.

00:03:53.901 --> 00:03:55.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:58.100
"My lady!"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:01.267
"I bring you a frozen potion.

00:04:01.267 --> 00:04:04.567
Made of almond milk
and the spice of a pumpkin."

00:04:04.567 --> 00:04:05.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.801 --> 00:04:08.567
"1/3 decaf, no foam.

00:04:08.567 --> 00:04:11.133
Grande in a vente cup,
as you have demanded."

00:04:11.133 --> 00:04:13.133
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.133 --> 00:04:17.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:17.234 --> 00:04:20.000
She's like this,
"Did you say almond milk?

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.434
Are you trying to ruin
the environment?"

00:04:21.434 --> 00:04:22.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.501 --> 00:04:25.367
"I asked for oat milk.
Take it away."

00:04:25.367 --> 00:04:28.534
"A thousand pardons, my lady."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:31.167
And then she's like, "Mummy,
will you take me to the mall?"

00:04:31.167 --> 00:04:33.200
"I shall prepare the carriage
and the bag of gold."

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:35.634
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.634 --> 00:04:37.601
So, of course,
to do everything

00:04:37.601 --> 00:04:39.534
for my daughter,
I got her a dog.

00:04:39.534 --> 00:04:41.901
And so, one day, the dog
was sitting on my lap,

00:04:41.901 --> 00:04:45.067
and she viciously bit me
on the nipple.

00:04:45.067 --> 00:04:46.601
[ Audience groans ]

00:04:46.601 --> 00:04:48.834
Do you have any idea
how painful it is to realize

00:04:48.834 --> 00:04:51.200
that your nipple
is accessible from your lap?

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:55.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:55.467 --> 00:04:56.834
Those were real tears.

00:04:56.834 --> 00:04:57.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you very much!

00:04:57.868 --> 00:04:59.501
I'm Caroline Rhea.

00:04:59.501 --> 00:05:00.901
♪♪

00:05:00.901 --> 00:05:03.100
-I mean, stop it!
Come on, now.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.868
Come on!
Come over here.

00:05:04.868 --> 00:05:06.000
Caroline Rhea!

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.834
We'll be right back
with more from Caroline!

00:05:07.834 --> 00:05:08.968
Come on, come on!

